"[EHL-DSP-002] Seeded dispute category %(code)s cannot be deleted; archive it"
" instead."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-002] 預置的爭議類別 %(code)s 無法刪除；請改為將其封存。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-DSP-003] Source model %(model)s is not in the dispute allow-list. "
"Permitted: %(list)s"
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-003] 來源模型 %(model)s 不在爭議允許清單中。允許的項目：%(list)s"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid "[EHL-DSP-004] Source record %(model)s/%(id)s does not exist."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-004] 來源記錄 %(model)s/%(id)s 不存在。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-DSP-005] Offered amount %(offered)s exceeds claimed amount %(claimed)s "
"for dispute %(name)s."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-005] 爭議 %(name)s 的報價金額 %(offered)s 超過了索賠金額 %(claimed)s。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-DSP-006] Cannot tender an offer for dispute %(name)s without an offered"
" amount."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-006] 未填寫報價金額時，無法為爭議 %(name)s 提交報價。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-DSP-007] Cannot mark dispute %(name)s settled without a settled amount."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-007] 未填寫和解金額時，無法將爭議 %(name)s 標記為已和解。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-DSP-008] Dispute state must change via the action methods, not by "
"direct write."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-008] 爭議狀態必須透過操作方法變更，而不能直接寫入。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-DSP-009] Dispute events are created by the dispute's action methods or "
"_log_event helper, not by direct ORM write."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-009] 爭議事件由爭議的操作方法或 _log_event 輔助函式建立，而不能透過直接的 ORM 寫入。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-DSP-010] Dispute event field(s) %(fields)s are immutable after "
"creation. Append a new event instead."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-010] 爭議事件欄位 %(fields)s 在建立後不可更改。請改為附加一個新事件。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_dispute.py:0
msgid "[EHL-DSP-011] Dispute events are append-only and cannot be deleted."
msgstr "[EHL-DSP-011] 爭議事件僅可附加，無法刪除。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_variation.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-VAR-001] Source model %(model)s is not in the variation allow-list."
msgstr "[EHL-VAR-001] 來源模型 %(model)s 不在變更允許清單中。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_variation.py:0
msgid "[EHL-VAR-002] Source record %(model)s/%(id)s does not exist."
msgstr "[EHL-VAR-002] 來源記錄 %(model)s/%(id)s 不存在。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_variation.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-VAR-003] Variation %(name)s has no lines; add at least one before "
"submitting."
msgstr "[EHL-VAR-003] 變更 %(name)s 沒有明細列；提交前請至少新增一列。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_variation.py:0
msgid ""
"[EHL-VAR-004] Variation %(name)s has no linked sale order; cannot apply."
msgstr "[EHL-VAR-004] 變更 %(name)s 沒有連結的銷售訂單；無法套用。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_variation.py:0
msgid "[EHL-VAR-005] Variation state must change via the action methods."
msgstr "[EHL-VAR-005] 變更狀態必須透過動作方法更改。"

#. module: eh_log_disputes_variations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/eh_log_disputes_variations/models/eh_log_variation.py:0
msgid "[EHL-VAR-006] Variation %(name)s is %(state)s; lines are read-only."
msgstr "[EHL-VAR-006] 變更 %(name)s 處於 %(state)s 狀態；明細列為唯讀。"

